    <bpmn:process id="W_W4491" name="W4491. Shelf-Edge Label &amp; Planogram Price Application" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Price change; reset; new-item; audit gap
Frequency: Daily + on reset
Volume: Shelf-edge labels across ~2.3–4.4 SKUs/sqm × ~1.6–3.0M sqm (profile §6.1)
Owner: Stores (VS-07) / Auto-ID Lead
Participants: Merchandising (VS-01), Planogram (VS-55), Pricing (VS-01.2)
Source: workflow W4491 — Shelf-Edge Label &amp; Planogram Price Application</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4491_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4491_Lane1" name="Stock Associate">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4491_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4491_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4491_Lane2" name="Department Supervisor">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4491_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4491_Lane3" name="Stores">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4491_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4491_End9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4491_Start5" name="Price change; reset; new-item; audit gap">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4491_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4491_Task6" name="Stock associates apply shelf-edge price labels per the print job/planogram…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Stock associates apply shelf-edge price labels per the print job/planogram (VS-55), matching label to facing and verifying barcode/price/unit correctness (RA 7394)
Responsible (R): Stock Associate
Accountable (A): Department Supervisor
Duration: Daily/on reset</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4491_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4491_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4491_Task7" name="Supervisor verify shelf-edge compliance vs planogram (VS-55) and price accuracy…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Supervisor verify shelf-edge compliance vs planogram (VS-55) and price accuracy (W4486), and flag/reprint mismatches
Responsible (R): Department Supervisor
Accountable (A): Store Manager
Duration: Daily</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4491_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4491_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4491_Task8" name="Stores capture shelf-edge compliance in the task app (VS-63) and feed…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Stores capture shelf-edge compliance in the task app (VS-63) and feed exceptions to Revenue Assurance (VS-118)
Responsible (R): Stores
Accountable (A): Store Manager
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4491_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4491_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4491_End9" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4491_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
