        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-684 (ensure controlled execution — Label &amp; Price-Tag Production, Printing &amp; In-Store Application (PA-151.2).) | - CTL-684: label-to-facing verified; stale labels replaced; RA 7394 price accuracy audited (W4486/VS-118)
Owner: Stores (VS-07) / Auto-ID Lead</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
