    <bpmn:process id="W_W4496" name="W4496. Label Application Quality, Reconciliation &amp; End-of-Life Media Control" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Periodic audit; reconciliation; media disposal
Frequency: Periodic + on media disposal
Volume: Application-quality audit + end-of-life media control across 205 sites
Owner: Auto-ID Lead / Quality (VS-31) / LP (VS-23)
Participants: Stores (VS-07), DC (VS-04), Audit (VS-21), Sustainability (VS-73)
Source: workflow W4496 — Label Application Quality, Reconciliation &amp; End-of-Life Media Control</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4496_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4496_Lane1" name="Auto-ID Lead">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4496_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4496_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4496_Lane2" name="LP">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4496_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4496_Lane3" name="Sustainability">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4496_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4496_End9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4496_Start5" name="Periodic audit; reconciliation; media disposal">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4496_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4496_Task6" name="Auto-ID Lead/Quality run application-quality audits (label present, correct…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Auto-ID Lead/Quality run application-quality audits (label present, correct, readable, planogram-matched) per W4486, reconcile print jobs vs applied (W4490), and quantify the gap
Responsible (R): Auto-ID Lead / Quality / Stores
Accountable (A): Master Data Manager / Quality Manager
Duration: Periodic</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4496_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4496_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4496_Task7" name="LP/Auto-ID Lead control end-of-life media — collect/destroy obsolete price…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: LP/Auto-ID Lead control end-of-life media — collect/destroy obsolete price labels/tags and spent ribbons to prevent tag-switch fraud and counterfeit-label reuse (links to VS-23)
Responsible (R): LP / Stores
Accountable (A): LP Director
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4496_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4496_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4496_Task8" name="Sustainability/Stores ensure label media waste is handled per the…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Sustainability/Stores ensure label media waste is handled per the circular-economy/waste program (VS-73) and consumable spend is reported (VS-135)
Responsible (R): Sustainability / Stores
Accountable (A): Sustainability Lead / IT Asset Manager
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4496_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4496_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4496_End9" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4496_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
