        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-150 (ensure labeling &amp; Auto-ID data integrity.) | - CTL-684: print job reconciled to application (VS-118); end-of-life media secured/destroyed (VS-23); media waste compliant (VS-73)
Owner: Auto-ID Lead / Quality (VS-31) / LP (VS-23)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
